splays to a vintage System 7 look and a classic car-inspired\n instrument cluster.\n\nNow comes with trip logging. Log individual trips and export all data including location and speed and maps!\n\nKey Features:\n- 17 speedometer designs in portrait & landscape\n- Apple Watch app with speed and map view\n- Head Up Display (HUD) mirror mode for windshield projection\n- Live speed graph with altitude overlay\n- Compass display\n- Speed warning with custom threshold\n- Speak speed aloud — eyes on the road\n- Export trip data as CSV\n- Adjustable max speed dial\n- Odometer with auto-reset option\n\nFree version included - unlock the Premium Pack for the full experience.\n\nSpeedBox uses GPS only while the app is open. No data usage for location. No background tracking.\n\nTerms of use: https://hans-schneider.de/speedbox_subscriptions_policy.html","released":"2009-03-27","updated":"2026-06-05","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/36/b9/d9/36b9d9cb-761c-beda-4b78-7ec54d9b0e92/AppIcon-free-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-11-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"4+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/36/b9/d9/36b9d9cb-761c-beda-4b78-7ec54d9b0e92/AppIcon-free-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-11-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Travel & Maps","rating":4.53,"ratings":37720,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":0,"hn_comments":0,"submissions":0,"self_n":0,"hn_score":2.0,"first":1524367809,"last":1524367809,"show_hn":null,"n_lab":1,"pos_pct":100,"neg_pct":0,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":16894573,"k":"ios:307529605","type":"comment","by":"nathancahill","time":1524367809,"text":"I use this Speedometer app: https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/speedometer-speed-box-app/id307529605","title":null,"story_id":16893772,"story_title":"A guide to building a fast electric skateboard at home","story_score":202,"comments":0,"w":1.0,"u":0,"s":"pos","self":false}],"slug":"speedometer-speed-box-trip-log"}